&lt;p&gt;12.&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;During the reporting period, the following changes occurred:&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: normal;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
