  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH6D09B49321ED2F9175728B9D8D482ABE" xlink:label="HH6D09B49321ED2F9175728B9D8D482ABE" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHEA7C19B9C7AA252CE23C6D038C9D1E26" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 118 Line No.: 1 Column: c</strong>
        </p>
        <p>ETC Tiger Pipeline, LLC, as a limited liability company, records member's equity in Other Paid-In Capital.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH6D09B49321ED2F9175728B9D8D482ABE" xlink:to="HHEA7C19B9C7AA252CE23C6D038C9D1E26" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHCB25123FD8BFAFED472E389B2328C2B9" xlink:label="HHCB25123FD8BFAFED472E389B2328C2B9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHDA05E4D79138D4EE0C24663FDA802B8C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <img title="1.gif" src="data:image/gif;base64," alt="" width="451" height="162" />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHCB25123FD8BFAFED472E389B2328C2B9" xlink:to="HHDA05E4D79138D4EE0C24663FDA802B8C" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHB70FDD91B1C2BBB59230D1D1D9D52CC3" xlink:label="HHB70FDD91B1C2BBB59230D1D1D9D52CC3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC268C291C37E8820A8138B4074D6246B" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: e</strong>
        </p>
        <p>The allocation is derived by determining whether the reservation rate charged within the billing system is discounted, negotiated or recourse. This determination is applied to the retained fuel charged per contract scheduled path, and a pro rata allocation is derived and applied to all volumes and dollars.</p>
        <p>The footnote also applies to column (e), lines 14, 22, 30, 37, 51, and 65.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHB70FDD91B1C2BBB59230D1D1D9D52CC3" xlink:to="HHC268C291C37E8820A8138B4074D6246B" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" xlink:label="HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHAABD48299B1745B09FAE3051324539C8" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <strong>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: f</strong>
        </p>
        <p>The basis for valuing the gas reported in columns (f), (g) and (h) is the Gas Daily monthly average index at East Texas, North Louisiana, and Carthage Hub.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE42A88354FE811940E49AF98CC4875FD" xlink:to="HHAABD48299B1745B09FAE3051324539C8" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH1D7A0CB770AA5D2BACEF5D553AE80C29" xlink:label="HH1D7A0CB770AA5D2BACEF5D553AE80C29" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH51E4F89044C1C293789131D8BBAE85DB" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
